  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The four Companions are now on their way back to Jorrvaskr from Riften.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869970
    - rid: 4972360430703869972
    - rid: 4972360430703869965
    - rid: 4972360475574796558
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703869973
    - rid: 4972360430703869974
    - rid: 4972360430703870090
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They successfully brought the Valmir matter to the attention of Jarl
      Laila Law-Giver...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But, after a brief debate in the court-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It was determined that there was no current recourse to punish the Thalmor;
      not during the civil war.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Though, the Stormcloak-friendly regime of Riften was quick to express
      desires for... radical retribution.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870036
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360430703870037
    - rid: 4972360430703870038
    - rid: 4972360430703870039
    - rid: 4972360430703870091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ({mc} picked a <i>real</i> good time to go wandering...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360459354374144
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360459354374145
    - rid: 4972360459354374146
    - rid: 4972360459354374147
    - rid: 4972360475574796555
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah. Here's the rain I smelled earlier.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360459354374148
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So where's this homeless girl at?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: What-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796585
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, do you mean Lucia?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You were serious about getting her a spot in Jorrvaskr?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I was!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796586
    - rid: 4972360475574796594
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: There's some poor girl out there living on the streets, and I can easily
      do something about it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796587
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd be wrong of me not to do what I can.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796588
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: You're being a bit naive, Jorrvaskr's no place for a child-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't care if I'm being naive!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: For the first time in my life-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: For the first time in my life...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796592
    - rid: 4972360475574796595
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: For the first time in my life, what <i>I</i> say goes...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796596
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever. Where is she?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796597
    - rid: 4972360475574796598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: If I remember right, she usually hangs around doing chores in the Bannered
      Mare.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Then that's where we're going.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796601
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Might as well get drinks while we're there, eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796602
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796603
    - rid: 4972360475574796604
    - rid: 4972360475574796605
    - rid: 4972360475574796606
    - rid: 4972360475574796607
    - rid: 4972360475574796611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: True to his word, Farkas takes a seat at the bar, with the other two
      joining him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796608
    - rid: 4972360475574796609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hulda, a bottle of Black-Briar for me-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas, you really drink that mammoth-spit?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796632
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, I don't tell you what you can and can't drink...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While they engage in chicanery galore, Natsuki looks around for a small
      child.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796610
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which doesn't take that long-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796633
    - rid: 4972360475574796634
    - rid: 4972360475574796635
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki finds a dirty-looking girl in a green dress, just in the room
      to the left of the entrance of the inn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796636
    - rid: 4972360475574796642
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: O-Oh, was I bothering you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753782
    - rid: 4972360499399753783
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, I'll get out of your way-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753784
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, no- actually, I wanted to talk to you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753785
    - rid: 4972360499399753786
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Did I do something bad?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753787
    - rid: 4972360499399753788
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What? No, no, no...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753789
    - rid: 4972360499399753790
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Look-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753791
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: How well can you handle a broom?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753792
    - rid: 4972360499399753793
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, I know how to sweep with one...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753794
    - rid: 4972360499399753795
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, that's good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753796
    - rid: 4972360499399753797
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: See, I'm with the Companions up in Jorrvaskr-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And our current maid, Tilma, is getting to be on the wrinkly side-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I figured we might as well train up her replacement sooner rather
      than later.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753798
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, I don't get it...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753799
    - rid: 4972360499399753800
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm saying <i>you're</i> going to be her replacement.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753802
    - rid: 4972360499399753803
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha- but I'm still just a kid...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753804
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, and Timla still has working joints. <i>For now</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753805
    - rid: 4972360499399753806
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So c'mon, let's get you started; Jorrvaskr isn't going to clean itself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753807
    - rid: 4972360499399753808
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, and the maid gets to stay there free-of-charge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753809
    - rid: 4972360499399753810
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: R-r-really?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753811
    - rid: 4972360499399753816
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll have a place to stay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753812
    - rid: 4972360499399753813
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep, as long as you do a good job cleaning.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753814
    - rid: 4972360499399753815
    - rid: 4972360499399753817
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll do a good job- the best job!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753818
    - rid: 4972360499399753819
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you, thank you, thank you!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753820
    - rid: 4972360499399753821
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753824
    - rid: 4972360499399753825
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, we'll probably have to give your clothes a wash...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753826
    - rid: 4972360499399753827
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: You're gonna wash my clothes too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753828
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dd6201afbe165745bd64197b76cdf48, type: 2}
    dialog: This is the best day of my life!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753829
    - rid: 4972360499399753830
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki leads Lucia back to where her fellow Companions are.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753831
    - rid: 4972360499399753832
    - rid: 4972360499399753833
    - rid: 4972360499399753834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright punks, break time's over.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753836
    - rid: 4972360499399753837
    - rid: 4972360499399753838
    - rid: 4972360499399753839
    - rid: 4972360499399753840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Very well. We'll probably have some paperwork to fill out when we arrive.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753841
    - rid: 4972360499399753842
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Meh. It can't be <i>that</i> bad...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753843
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753844
    - rid: 4972360499399753845
    - rid: 4972360499399753846
    - rid: 4972360499399753847
    - rid: 4972360499399753848
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh dang, I didn't notice the rain getting more intense...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753849
    - rid: 4972360499399753850
    - rid: 4972360499399753851
    - rid: 4972360499399753852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's move.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753853
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753854
    - rid: 4972360499399753855
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753856
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753857
    - rid: 4972360499399753858
    - rid: 4972360499399753859
    - rid: 4972360499399753860
    - rid: 4972360499399753861
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas, you go ahead and take Lucia to Tilma while Vilkas and I take
      care of business-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753862
    - rid: 4972360499399753863
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela, you're off the hook, go do whatever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753864
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As instructed, Farkas guides Lucia while Aela makes herself scarce.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753865
    - rid: 4972360499399753866
    - rid: 4972360499399753867
    - rid: 4972360499399753868
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's see here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: While we were gone, Athis completed a job and was paid-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753870
    - rid: 4972360499399753871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: You'll need to note down the 100 septim expenditure in the record.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yep, got it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753873
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: What's next... ah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753874
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: We've got another job offer, it seems to be more standard than the previous
      one-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Just some intimidation job.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Eh, that should be fine, go ahead and let the others know about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753875
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Right, right...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753876
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm, that seems to be it. Slow day, I guess.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, actually we've got something here from Eorlund-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753877
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: It looks like he wants to talk to you about getting you some new armor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh thank goodness, I've been sick and tired of not having sleeves...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753878
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But, we'll have to wait a bit to deal with that-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753879
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '''Cause, you know, <i>rain</i>.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's all. I'll be upstairs if you need me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Vilkas, as his parting words imply, heads upstairs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753882
    - rid: 4972360499399753883
    - rid: 4972360499399753884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360499399753885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Um. <b>Player</b>, or whoever the hell you are, are <b>you</b> there?)
