            dialog: I don't know. I don't think I could've done better...
            ScreenActions: []
    - rid: 4972360592123756613
      type: {class: Actor_Expression, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        actorToAlter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
        visualSpriteIndexes:
        - 
        - 
        - concernBlush
        - 
    - rid: 4972360592123756614
      type: {class: Conditional_Screen_Overrider, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        possibleScreens:
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: garbage
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            debugResult: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
            dialog: You gave some poor orphan girl a safe roof over her head <i>and</i>
              a secure future-
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: garbage
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 1
            persistent: 0
            debugResult: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
            dialog: I mean, you sorta just took a homeless girl and made her an indentured
              servant-
            ScreenActions:
            - rid: 4972360592123756615
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: garbage
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 2
            persistent: 0
            debugResult: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
            dialog: (Hmm...)
            ScreenActions: []
    - rid: 4972360592123756615
      type: {class: Actor_Expression, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        actorToAlter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
        visualSpriteIndexes:
        - 
        - 
        - tsunShock
        - 
    - rid: 4972360592123756616
      type: {class: Conditional_Screen_Overrider, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        possibleScreens:
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: garbage
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            debugResult: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
            dialog: Okay, maybe not a <i>luxurious</i> future...
            ScreenActions:
            - rid: 4972360592123756617
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: garbage
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 1
            persistent: 0
            debugResult: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
            dialog: I feel like she'd be better off in an orphanage, or adopted.
              That way she could be a kid.
            ScreenActions:
            - rid: 4972360592123756618
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: garbage
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 2
            persistent: 0
            debugResult: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
            dialog: Sorry. I don't think I've got the wisdom to be able to tell you
              if you're right or wrong.
            ScreenActions: []
    - rid: 4972360592123756617
      type: {class: Actor_Expression, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        actorToAlter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
        visualSpriteIndexes:
